    "Untrusted path/alias/issuer/client hints select only a target candidate, never authenticated authority.",
    "Admission lookup uses issuer primary authority with exact canonical UUID, incarnation, deployment/recovery epoch, enrollment state, profile version, revision and operation class. No application DB, lease, TTL cache or route allowlist is authority.",
    "An authoritative explicit unmanaged classification is required; missing, ambiguous, stale, inaccessible, restored or changed state cannot mean unmanaged.",
    "Minimal bootstrap reads only admission directory/enrollment data; no user/client/grant/credential/policy/mapper/session/key/eager-realm fields, repair or runtime record creation. Exact native storage/transaction API remains unproved.",
    "Revalidate scope at realm/client binding changes, nested operations, jobs/retries/resumes and before native emission under the same required durable fence; do not serialize thread-local admission as a bearer capability.",
